title: "tpu-retrieval-bench: exact top-k retrieval on TPU, XLA versus Pallas"
abstract: "A JAX and Pallas benchmark for exact top-k embedding retrieval on TPU. It measures when a hand-written Pallas kernel beats stock XLA, with recall checks, roofline labels and repetition statistics."
